Delete char under/before cursor, delete/change to line end, change
char/line, replace char with \f[CR]x\f[R], or toggle case and move right
(\f[CR]\[ti]\f[R]).
T}
T{
\f[CR]p\f[R], \f[CR]P\f[R], \f[CR]o\f[R], \f[CR]O\f[R], \f[CR]J\f[R]
T}@T{
Paste after/before cursor, open line below/above, or join next line with
1 space.
T}
