T{
\f[CR]/\f[R], \f[CR]?\f[R], \f[CR]n\f[R], \f[CR]N\f[R], \f[CR]:\f[R]
T}@T{
Search history (or buffer text in \f[CR]slurp\f[R] with
\f[CR]n\f[R]/\f[CR]N\f[R] repeats), or open \f[CR]:\f[R] command prompt.
